WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.840
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.110 --> 01:48.009
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.070 --> 01:50.990
[Episode 14]

4
01:51.009 --> 01:53.080
[Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse]

5
01:51.979 --> 01:52.370
Okay.

6
01:52.370 --> 01:53.370
See you tomorrow.

7
01:54.380 --> 01:55.370
Here is your room key.

8
01:55.370 --> 01:55.759
Thank you.

9
01:55.759 --> 01:56.820
Please come again.

10
01:58.070 --> 01:58.920
Take care.

11
02:09.000 --> 02:09.660
Congsheng,

12
02:10.080 --> 02:12.060
why hasn't your Tangy arrived yet?

13
02:12.210 --> 02:13.470
She has something to do and will be late.

14
02:13.470 --> 02:14.270
What's wrong?

15
02:15.910 --> 02:16.710
Nothing.

16
02:16.750 --> 02:17.560
Nothing.

17
02:18.579 --> 02:19.579
You usually take every chance

18
02:19.579 --> 02:20.680
to lounge around.

19
02:20.970 --> 02:22.120
Why are you wandering around

20
02:22.120 --> 02:23.520
with a crutch today?

21
02:24.780 --> 02:25.560
I'm just afraid that you

22
02:25.560 --> 02:26.470
can't handle it alone,

23
02:26.470 --> 02:27.530
so I'm helping you.

24
02:28.579 --> 02:29.410
Fu Zhengchu,

25
02:29.520 --> 02:30.620
the way you care about others

26
02:30.620 --> 02:31.710
is quite scary.

27
02:32.579 --> 02:33.410
He who is overly attentive

28
02:33.410 --> 02:34.360
usually has an ulterior motive.

29
02:34.360 --> 02:36.290
Just tell me if you need something.

30
02:36.810 --> 02:37.579
Nothing.

31
02:37.579 --> 02:39.620
I just stayed in the room

32
02:39.620 --> 02:40.150
for too long

33
02:40.150 --> 02:41.210
and came out to stretch.

34
02:41.210 --> 02:42.360
You have too much free time, right?

35
02:42.360 --> 02:43.210
Then I'll leave this to you.

36
02:43.210 --> 02:44.710
I happen to have something to do and need to go out.

37
02:44.710 --> 02:45.079
Wait, don't go.

38
02:45.079 --> 02:45.970
I'm on a crutch.

39
02:45.970 --> 02:47.500
I'll just be in the way here.

40
02:47.750 --> 02:48.500
Xia.

41
02:49.590 --> 02:50.870
Sorry, I'm late.

42
02:50.870 --> 02:51.680
Tangy, you're here.

43
02:51.680 --> 02:52.620
Then I'll leave this to you.

44
02:52.620 --> 02:53.620
I happen to have something to do and need to go out.

45
02:53.620 --> 02:54.310
Go ahead.

46
03:02.970 --> 03:04.630
You were late today, you know.

47
03:04.680 --> 03:06.120
Although my sister didn't scold you,

48
03:06.120 --> 03:07.280
I still have to remind you

49
03:07.280 --> 03:08.610
not to be late next time.

50
03:08.680 --> 03:10.150
Your sister owns the guesthouse.

51
03:10.150 --> 03:11.810
I am your sister's employee.

52
03:11.910 --> 03:13.520
What does it have to do with you?

53
03:13.520 --> 03:14.370
What's wrong with you today?

54
03:14.370 --> 03:14.810
Why are you

55
03:14.810 --> 03:16.020
so fired up?

56
03:16.210 --> 03:17.250
Who bullied you?

57
03:25.520 --> 03:27.120
My leg hurts.

58
03:27.120 --> 03:28.650
Don't you care about it?

59
03:28.970 --> 03:30.500
What's there to care about?

60
03:30.680 --> 03:31.710
I don't think it

61
03:31.710 --> 03:32.910
cramps your fun.

62
03:33.310 --> 03:35.460
This is called having a good mindset.

63
03:36.810 --> 03:37.620
With a pretty girl by your side,

64
03:37.620 --> 03:39.480
of course you have a good mindset.

65
03:40.370 --> 03:41.300
What did you say?

66
03:46.390 --> 03:47.360
Is there any bone soup

67
03:47.360 --> 03:48.650
tonight?

68
03:50.820 --> 03:51.760
No bones,

69
03:52.210 --> 03:53.520
but I have a fist.

70
03:53.620 --> 03:54.410
Want a taste?

71
04:03.050 --> 04:04.250
Why did she snap at me?

72
04:49.120 --> 04:50.450
How about sitting here?

73
04:51.920 --> 04:52.770
I'll go order.

74
04:59.420 --> 05:00.680
Hello. Two lattes

75
05:01.220 --> 05:02.420
and two matcha cakes.

76
05:03.000 --> 05:03.690
Shize,

77
05:03.810 --> 05:04.660
you're back.

78
05:04.930 --> 05:05.810
Is there anything you need to do

79
05:05.810 --> 05:07.010
back at school today?

80
05:08.180 --> 05:10.440
I have a speech at school this afternoon.

81
05:11.360 --> 05:13.740
Come back and visit often when you have time.

82
05:13.740 --> 05:15.240
To see the professors and classmates.

83
05:15.240 --> 05:15.720
Yes.

84
05:16.770 --> 05:17.750
Hello.

85
05:18.000 --> 05:18.920
Let's go over there first.

86
05:18.920 --> 05:19.860
We meet again.

87
05:20.010 --> 05:21.190
This seat is taken.

88
05:22.220 --> 05:23.770
But no one is here right now.

89
05:27.770 --> 05:28.750
This is my seat.

90
05:30.250 --> 05:31.050
Senior Fu.

91
05:31.270 --> 05:32.150
Hello, hello.

92
05:33.770 --> 05:34.770
My name is Chen Lirong.

93
05:34.770 --> 05:36.120
I'm a joint PhD student under the supervision of

94
05:36.120 --> 05:37.580
Professors Shi and Xiang.

95
05:42.070 --> 05:42.870
Senior Fu,

96
05:43.370 --> 05:44.220
there's another seat here.

97
05:44.220 --> 05:45.420
I'll just sit here...

98
06:04.220 --> 06:05.010
Well,

99
06:05.450 --> 06:07.180
work ends tomorrow.

100
06:07.660 --> 06:09.680
When is your flight?

101
06:10.420 --> 06:11.220
Wednesday.

102
06:13.510 --> 06:14.510
I booked mine too.

103
06:15.060 --> 06:16.010
For Thursday.

104
06:27.690 --> 06:29.340
What time is your flight?

105
06:32.220 --> 06:34.120
6:15 AM.

106
06:39.220 --> 06:41.220
The airport is really far from here.

107
06:41.270 --> 06:42.600
How about I drop you off?

108
06:55.220 --> 06:56.330
Hello, everyone, I am

109
06:55.850 --> 06:59.710
[Xifu University of Science and Technology]

110
06:56.330 --> 06:57.650
Fu Shize from EAW.

111
06:57.920 --> 06:59.680
It's an honor to be here at XUST

112
07:00.240 --> 07:01.300
to introduce VR

113
07:01.520 --> 07:03.650
and help everyone learn more about it.

114
07:03.910 --> 07:06.050
Compared to traditional immersive spaces,

115
07:06.050 --> 07:07.080
large-scale VR has advantages

116
07:07.080 --> 07:09.740
such as a high degree of freedom in interaction,

117
07:09.810 --> 07:10.810
diverse gameplay,

118
07:10.810 --> 07:11.870
deep immersion,

119
07:12.070 --> 07:13.920
and social interaction.

120
07:14.220 --> 07:16.180
We can break the barriers

121
07:16.420 --> 07:18.350
of physical space through actions

122
07:18.480 --> 07:20.420
such as walking and grabbing.

123
07:20.690 --> 07:22.060
Take this VR headset

124
07:22.340 --> 07:23.670
in my hand as an example.

125
07:24.500 --> 07:25.800
We've incorporated

126
07:26.130 --> 07:27.130
real-time kinematic

127
07:27.130 --> 07:28.240
GPS technology into it.

128
07:28.240 --> 07:29.300
Hello, beautiful.

129
07:33.260 --> 07:33.900
Excuse me.

130
07:33.930 --> 07:35.530
I need to get some documents.

131
07:37.200 --> 07:38.080
Your boyfriend

132
07:38.560 --> 07:40.560
is quite a prominent figure at XUST.

133
07:41.120 --> 07:41.890
Want to hear about

134
07:41.890 --> 07:42.720
some of the things

135
07:42.720 --> 07:43.920
he's done in the past?

136
07:44.890 --> 07:45.810
Whatever it is about him,

137
07:45.810 --> 07:47.270
I don't need you to tell me.

138
07:47.420 --> 07:48.190
If he wants to talk about it,

139
07:48.190 --> 07:49.520
he will tell me himself.

140
07:55.300 --> 07:56.000
Excuse me.

141
08:37.740 --> 08:38.480
Sorry

142
08:38.510 --> 08:39.640
to keep you waiting.

143
08:40.320 --> 08:41.250
Let's continue.

144
08:42.360 --> 08:43.720
On our helmet

145
08:43.909 --> 08:45.120
and the controllers,

146
08:45.290 --> 08:46.650
there are over 70

147
08:46.650 --> 08:48.110
photosensitive sensors.

148
08:48.510 --> 08:49.460
As the laser sweeps

149
08:49.460 --> 08:50.600
across the sensors,

150
08:51.050 --> 08:51.820
we can use

151
08:51.820 --> 08:52.860
the positions of the sensors

152
08:52.860 --> 08:54.250
and the controllers,

153
08:54.910 --> 08:57.250
along with the laser's reach...

154
09:39.860 --> 09:41.060
Let me give you a ride.

155
09:41.100 --> 09:42.230
My car is over there.

156
09:42.460 --> 09:43.250
No need.

157
09:43.510 --> 09:44.910
My ride is arriving soon.

158
09:55.220 --> 09:56.020
Wait a minute.

159
10:07.320 --> 10:08.110
I'm leaving.

160
10:34.410 --> 10:35.340
When I see you,

161
10:35.910 --> 10:37.860
it's like seeing the moon.

162
11:08.440 --> 11:09.100
Li.

163
11:10.130 --> 11:11.870
I warmed some milk for you.

164
11:12.030 --> 11:13.360
Drink it while it's hot.

165
11:15.100 --> 11:16.410
Did you poison me?

166
11:16.910 --> 11:18.080
How could I?

167
11:18.080 --> 11:19.390
Since you're leaving,

168
11:19.390 --> 11:21.390
I thought I'd come check on you.

169
11:22.890 --> 11:25.010
Okay, thanks.

170
11:31.720 --> 11:33.410
You've shown you care,

171
11:33.410 --> 11:34.910
and I drank the milk.

172
11:34.910 --> 11:35.510
If there's nothing else,

173
11:35.510 --> 11:36.720
you can leave now.

174
11:37.740 --> 11:38.700
Look at you.

175
11:38.700 --> 11:40.080
You're not sleeping anyway.

176
11:40.080 --> 11:40.700
Just let me stay here

177
11:40.700 --> 11:41.390
for a while.

178
11:41.390 --> 11:42.030
Fine.

179
11:42.030 --> 11:43.250
Stay if you want.

180
12:22.840 --> 12:24.240
Do you have hemorrhoids?

181
12:24.770 --> 12:25.720
No.

182
12:27.120 --> 12:27.870
It's fine.

183
12:27.870 --> 12:29.130
Kids at your age

184
12:29.130 --> 12:30.370
sit and study all day.

185
12:30.370 --> 12:32.080
It's normal to have this problem.

186
12:32.080 --> 12:34.320
Just walk more every day,

187
12:34.370 --> 12:35.170
drink more water,

188
12:35.170 --> 12:36.410
and cut back on those snacks that are considered too heaty.

189
12:36.410 --> 12:37.050
unhealthy snacks.

190
12:37.050 --> 12:38.200
I really don't.

191
12:41.130 --> 12:41.940
I know.

192
12:42.220 --> 12:42.910
For the next few days,

193
12:42.910 --> 12:44.620
just try to have a bowel movement regularly.

194
12:44.620 --> 12:45.340
If you can't,

195
12:45.340 --> 12:46.740
don't force it.

196
12:47.030 --> 12:48.080
Let's see how things go over the next few days.

197
12:48.080 --> 12:49.720
If it doesn't work, ask Mom to take you to the hospital.

198
12:49.720 --> 12:50.220
I know.

199
12:50.480 --> 12:51.130
I know.

200
12:51.620 --> 12:53.420
Do you have anything else to say?

201
12:54.240 --> 12:56.170
I'm leaving tomorrow.

202
12:56.530 --> 12:57.930
Be good at home.

203
12:57.950 --> 12:59.550
Don't make Mom and Dad angry.

204
13:02.190 --> 13:02.990
Oh, right, Li.

205
13:05.250 --> 13:06.000
Wait for me.

206
13:18.370 --> 13:19.240
Don't even think about it.

207
13:19.240 --> 13:20.130
I have no money.

208
13:20.390 --> 13:21.910
Am I that kind of person?

209
13:22.530 --> 13:24.440
I guess I've misjudged you.

210
13:24.840 --> 13:25.870
Do you still remember

211
13:25.870 --> 13:28.530
that 302.5 yuan?

212
13:28.720 --> 13:29.860
Do you remember?

213
13:29.880 --> 13:30.880
You owe me.

214
13:35.200 --> 13:35.910
Yes.

215
13:39.840 --> 13:41.170
I transferred it to you.

216
13:46.080 --> 13:47.680
You call this paying me back?

217
13:48.770 --> 13:49.960
I don't have money.

218
13:49.960 --> 13:51.690
I can only pay in installments.

219
13:51.880 --> 13:53.050
But I promise I'll transfer

220
13:53.050 --> 13:54.940
2.5 yuan to you

221
13:55.030 --> 13:56.530
on the first of every month.

222
13:56.530 --> 13:57.550
Sooner or later,

223
13:57.700 --> 13:59.230
I'll definitely pay it off.

224
14:00.820 --> 14:01.720
300 yuan,

225
14:01.820 --> 14:03.220
and you're paying it over 10 years?

226
14:03.220 --> 14:04.580
Why don't you wait until my 80th birthday

227
14:04.580 --> 14:05.530
to pay me back?

228
14:06.440 --> 14:07.440
Not necessarily.

229
14:07.750 --> 14:08.770
Maybe one day,

230
14:08.770 --> 14:10.360
when my financial situation

231
14:10.360 --> 14:11.510
is better,

232
14:11.670 --> 14:12.340
I...

233
14:13.180 --> 14:13.920
Go on.

234
14:13.940 --> 14:14.810
I'm recording.

235
14:15.270 --> 14:17.630
I could pay you back all at once.

236
14:18.410 --> 14:19.220
Okay.

237
14:19.220 --> 14:20.510
I'm counting on you.

238
14:23.480 --> 14:24.530
So what is it?

239
14:25.670 --> 14:27.170
I just want you

240
14:27.510 --> 14:29.510
to bring something to a friend for me.

241
14:29.510 --> 14:30.240
Who is it for?

242
14:30.390 --> 14:31.110
The girl

243
14:31.140 --> 14:32.900
you saw the other day.

244
14:33.910 --> 14:35.910
Her brother went to work in Nanwu,

245
14:36.010 --> 14:37.770
and she transferred there too.

246
14:39.080 --> 14:40.550
Why don't you mail it to her?

247
14:40.550 --> 14:42.290
I glued it myself.

248
14:42.290 --> 14:44.490
I'm afraid it'll fall apart if I mail it.

249
14:47.150 --> 14:48.010
Li,

250
14:48.010 --> 14:49.410
please.

251
14:49.410 --> 14:50.120
Wait,

252
14:50.320 --> 14:51.850
you're not dating, are you?

253
14:51.870 --> 14:52.980
I'm really not.

254
14:53.240 --> 14:54.770
We are just good friends.

255
14:54.770 --> 14:55.770
Pure friendship.

256
14:57.170 --> 14:57.960
But

257
14:58.700 --> 15:00.000
don't tell Mom and Dad.

258
15:00.170 --> 15:01.700
I'm afraid Dad will beat me.

259
15:02.480 --> 15:03.750
Don't date too early.

260
15:05.120 --> 15:06.220
Got it.

261
15:06.390 --> 15:07.320
I love studying.

262
15:07.320 --> 15:08.770
Studying makes me happy.

263
15:10.720 --> 15:11.850
I'll think about it.

264
15:12.790 --> 15:13.250
But are you

265
15:13.250 --> 15:14.870
asking me to meet her and give it to her?

266
15:14.870 --> 15:15.960
I don't want to go.

267
15:16.870 --> 15:18.250
Please, Yun Li.

268
15:18.250 --> 15:19.370
Please.

269
15:19.370 --> 15:20.320
I stayed up for several nights

270
15:20.320 --> 15:21.410
to make it.

271
15:22.100 --> 15:22.840
Fine.

272
15:22.840 --> 15:24.240
Bring it here.

273
15:24.870 --> 15:25.670
Really?

274
15:26.210 --> 15:27.130
Wait for me here.

275
15:27.130 --> 15:28.460
Wait for me. Wait for me.

276
15:32.840 --> 15:34.940
Why are we so alike?

277
16:07.960 --> 16:09.030
Have a nice trip.

278
16:11.290 --> 16:12.220
-Hello. -Hello.

279
16:13.050 --> 16:13.860
Just a moment.

280
16:21.960 --> 16:23.050
Have a nice trip.

281
16:23.050 --> 16:23.750
Thank you.

282
16:29.740 --> 16:31.290
My flight was canceled,

283
16:31.290 --> 16:32.630
so I changed to this one.

284
16:34.970 --> 16:36.000
Why don't you wait for me?

285
16:36.000 --> 16:37.000
I'll check in too.

286
16:41.440 --> 16:42.000
Hello.

287
16:42.000 --> 16:42.740
Hello.

288
16:43.130 --> 16:44.340
I'm friends

289
16:44.340 --> 16:45.000
with the gentleman who was just here.

290
16:45.000 --> 16:46.000
His name is Fu Shize.

291
16:46.000 --> 16:47.390
Can I sit with him?

292
16:47.700 --> 16:48.600
You want the seat

293
16:48.600 --> 16:50.250
next to this gentleman, right?

294
16:50.250 --> 16:51.050
Just a moment.

295
17:22.160 --> 17:23.250
If you can see it,

296
17:23.530 --> 17:24.460
I can see it too.

297
17:27.290 --> 17:30.000
I just wanted to see if you were asleep.

298
17:31.200 --> 17:31.740
No.

299
17:34.440 --> 17:35.240
Um,

300
17:36.590 --> 17:39.710
did you see the thing

301
17:39.740 --> 17:41.050
I left for you?

302
17:43.000 --> 17:45.330
The one with a moon

303
17:45.330 --> 17:47.460
and a sticky note.

304
17:50.550 --> 17:51.410
What did it say?

305
17:54.200 --> 17:55.000
Tell me.

306
17:56.140 --> 17:57.850
You threw away the brochure?

307
18:00.290 --> 18:01.150
I threw it away.

308
18:05.330 --> 18:06.140
Forget it.

309
18:23.350 --> 18:24.140
Recently,

310
18:24.140 --> 18:26.080
we were busy with launching Light Chaser.

311
18:26.080 --> 18:26.840
All departments

312
18:26.840 --> 18:28.050
were working overtime.

313
18:28.050 --> 18:29.250
Especially the publicity department.

314
18:29.250 --> 18:30.850
Thank you for your hard work.

315
18:31.130 --> 18:32.170
So next,

316
18:32.200 --> 18:33.800
everyone can ease up a little

317
18:33.850 --> 18:34.740
and focus on

318
18:34.740 --> 18:36.090
our next-stage goals.

319
18:36.400 --> 18:37.200
Ms. Fang,

320
18:37.500 --> 18:39.590
we still need to tell the engineering department

321
18:39.590 --> 18:40.550
to continue the daily maintenance and updates

322
18:40.550 --> 18:42.330
for Light Chaser.

323
18:42.900 --> 18:43.530
Okay.

324
18:44.110 --> 18:45.140
Let's end today's meeting

325
18:45.140 --> 18:46.200
here.

326
18:51.500 --> 18:52.290
By the way,

327
18:52.600 --> 18:54.000
before the meeting ends,

328
18:54.090 --> 18:55.690
I still want to say one thing.

329
18:55.960 --> 18:56.740
I know recently

330
18:56.740 --> 18:57.790
there have been a lot of rumors

331
18:57.790 --> 18:59.390
circulating in the company.

332
18:59.700 --> 19:00.590
But in order to maintain

333
19:00.590 --> 19:01.290
our company's

334
19:01.290 --> 19:03.690
positive and healthy working atmosphere,

335
19:03.740 --> 19:05.030
I hope this matter

336
19:05.460 --> 19:06.400
ends here.

337
19:07.000 --> 19:08.600
Everyone should still focus

338
19:08.740 --> 19:09.830
on work.

339
19:11.330 --> 19:12.460
Meeting adjourned.

340
19:34.960 --> 19:35.960
Dear passengers,

341
19:36.160 --> 19:37.790
we're experiencing some turbulence

342
19:37.790 --> 19:38.940
and brief shaking.

343
19:39.200 --> 19:40.220
For your safety,

344
19:40.400 --> 19:41.660
please return to your seats immediately

345
19:41.660 --> 19:43.190
and fasten your seatbelts.

346
19:55.350 --> 19:57.750
Are we running into turbulence?

347
20:16.900 --> 20:18.970
I... I still can't hear.

348
20:28.000 --> 20:29.390
