358
21:08.680 --> 21:09.180
Mm.

359
21:18.310 --> 21:19.110
What's wrong?

360
21:24.030 --> 21:26.790
You seem to really like saying "mm."

361
21:33.920 --> 21:35.850
Let's just leave the contact name as it is.

362
21:35.850 --> 21:37.310
It sounds pretty nice too.

363
21:46.880 --> 21:47.380
Mm.

364
21:53.680 --> 21:54.480
Mm.

365
22:01.530 --> 22:02.290
Can we

366
22:02.290 --> 22:03.620
