367
22:04.250 --> 22:05.450
I want to share a ride.

368
22:05.610 --> 22:06.540
It's a bit late.

369
22:06.570 --> 22:08.370
Taking a taxi is a bit expensive.

370
22:24.240 --> 22:25.810
Xu Qingsong is coming to pick me up.

371
22:25.810 --> 22:27.270
He'll give you a ride back.

372
23:46.110 --> 23:48.720
Were you happy in Xifu these past few days?

373
23:50.850 --> 23:53.290
