374
23:55.160 --> 23:56.900
Was he unhappy in Xifu?

375
24:03.090 --> 24:03.750
Forget it.

376
24:03.750 --> 24:04.950
I'll go take a shower.

377
24:14.250 --> 24:14.750
Mm.

378
24:25.770 --> 24:28.050
[Steal A Moment To Sip Wine Guesthouse]

379
24:31.380 --> 24:31.960
Tangy!

380
24:32.400 --> 24:33.200
Lili!

381
24:34.070 --> 24:34.970
You're back.

382
24:35.370 --> 24:36.580
You look good.

383
24:36.700 --> 24:37.460
I'm okay.

384
24:37.460 --> 24:38.400
I brought you a lot of food.

385
24:38.400 --> 24:38.940
It's in my room.

386
24:38.940 --> 24:39.640
Go get it.

387
24:39.750 --> 24:41.500
Are you going to work?

388
24:41.700 --> 24:43.140
Aren't you going to rest for a few more days?

389
24:43.140 --> 24:44.030
I'm fine now.

390
24:44.030 --> 24:45.960
