391
24:47.330 --> 24:48.140
Lili.

392
24:49.030 --> 24:49.700
Morning.

393
24:50.960 --> 24:52.090
How's your leg?

394
24:52.090 --> 24:52.660
It's fine.

395
24:52.660 --> 24:54.060
