402
25:04.660 --> 25:06.050
Fu Shize went to Xifu?

403
25:06.400 --> 25:07.290
To find you?

404
25:08.260 --> 25:09.060
No.

405
25:09.090 --> 25:10.090
He went to attend

406
25:10.090 --> 25:11.440
