407
25:11.550 --> 25:12.250
It was purely for work.

408
25:12.250 --> 25:13.780
It had nothing to do with me.

409
25:13.960 --> 25:15.440
I don't think so.

410
25:15.500 --> 25:16.590
The work was secondary.

411
25:16.590 --> 25:18.650
Accompanying you was the main point.

412
25:20.400 --> 25:22.140
That's Fu Shize for you.

413
25:22.140 --> 25:23.440
So considerate.

414
25:23.750 --> 25:25.330
Unlike someone who flirts around

415
25:25.330 --> 25:27.000
all day, keeps a crowd

416
25:27.000 --> 25:27.810
of girls around him,

417
25:27.810 --> 25:29.140
all kinds of girls,

418
25:29.430 --> 25:30.430
and would love to give every girl

419
25:30.430 --> 25:31.850
