420
25:32.250 --> 25:32.940
Wait, Tang Lin,

421
25:32.940 --> 25:34.030
what do you mean?

422
25:34.140 --> 25:35.600
Don't you know what I mean?

423
25:35.850 --> 25:37.000
Okay, stop.

424
25:37.000 --> 25:37.460
Stop arguing.

425
25:37.460 --> 25:38.200
I'm going to work.

426
25:38.200 --> 25:39.460
I'm leaving. Bye-bye.

427
25:39.500 --> 25:40.030
Bye-bye.

428
25:40.030 --> 25:40.570
Bye-bye.

429
25:43.350 --> 25:44.330
What's going on?

430
25:44.330 --> 25:45.730
So passive-aggressive.

431
25:45.750 --> 25:46.810
What did I do again?

432
25:50.160 --> 25:51.290
Come try this.

433
25:51.400 --> 25:52.140
Thank you.

434
25:52.140 --> 25:52.850
The first time I saw you,

435
25:52.850 --> 25:53.850
I thought you were a nice person

436
25:53.850 --> 25:54.550
and easy to get along with.

437
25:54.550 --> 25:55.350
So did I.

438
25:55.350 --> 25:56.810
When you were being slandered recently,

439
25:56.810 --> 25:58.070
I even spoke up for you.

440
25:58.280 --> 25:59.090
Thank you.

441
26:02.180 --> 26:02.780
Tingting.

442
26:03.440 --> 26:04.000
Tingting.

443
26:04.000 --> 26:04.740
Eat this.

444
26:04.810 --> 26:05.410
Thank you.

445
26:05.790 --> 26:06.480
And yours.

446
26:06.530 --> 26:07.290
Thank you.

447
26:07.500 --> 26:08.900
Mr. Zhao, yours.

448
26:09.160 --> 26:09.960
Thank you.

449
26:18.700 --> 26:19.530
Mr. Qin,

450
26:19.570 --> 26:21.250
I brought you some Xifu specialties.

451
26:21.250 --> 26:22.050
Yun Li,

452
26:22.140 --> 26:22.960
