457
26:32.050 --> 26:34.440
Thanks for your hard work on the XUST matter.

458
26:34.440 --> 26:35.840
No, it's what I should do.

459
26:36.240 --> 26:37.050
Seeing that you're fine,

460
26:37.050 --> 26:38.200
