463
26:41.700 --> 26:42.750
It's all in the past.

464
26:42.750 --> 26:43.900
People can't always be affected

465
26:43.900 --> 26:45.640
by those unfounded rumors.

466
26:46.550 --> 26:47.440
That's true.

467
26:48.640 --> 26:49.440
Jiameng.

468
26:50.240 --> 26:51.370
Here's this for you.

469
26:52.460 --> 26:53.500
I brought you

470
26:53.500 --> 26:54.640
a local specialty from Xifu.

471
26:54.640 --> 26:55.160
There are two more.

472
26:55.160 --> 26:55.830
Can you help me give them

473
26:55.830 --> 26:57.140
to Mr. Xu and Ms. Fang?

474
26:57.900 --> 26:59.060
Then thank you.

475
26:59.090 --> 27:00.090
Sorry for the trouble.

476
27:00.090 --> 27:00.740
By the way,

477
27:01.380 --> 27:03.660
