478
27:03.660 --> 27:05.000
Mr. Xu gave a strict order.

479
27:05.000 --> 27:06.600
No gossiping in the company.

480
27:07.590 --> 27:08.940
Just focus on your work.

481
27:09.200 --> 27:10.400
I'll get back to work.

482
27:46.680 --> 27:48.080
What on earth is he doing?

483
27:48.310 --> 27:49.700
I can never run into him.

484
28:16.330 --> 28:18.390
Let's have dinner together tonight.

485
28:45.700 --> 28:47.610
No, I have to work overtime.

486
29:21.610 --> 29:22.940
Do you want some coffee?

487
29:23.000 --> 29:24.110
I'll make you a cup.

488
29:30.560 --> 29:31.620
I already have one.

489
29:48.220 --> 29:49.590
Aren't you just setting yourself up for disappointment,

490
29:49.590 --> 29:50.420
Yun Li?

491
29:52.480 --> 29:53.350
I'm leaving.

492
29:53.370 --> 29:53.900
Bye-bye.

493
29:53.900 --> 29:54.580
Bye-bye.

494
29:54.610 --> 29:55.380
I'm leaving, Yun Li.

495
29:55.380 --> 29:56.110
Bye-bye.

496
30:09.990 --> 30:12.120
Let's have dinner together tonight.

497
30:20.940 --> 30:22.200
He always rejects me.

498
30:22.850 --> 30:24.450
What if I put it the other way?

499
30:41.200 --> 30:43.640
Are we eating dinner separately?

500
30:51.750 --> 30:53.810
Let's have dinner together tonight.

501
31:06.060 --> 31:06.750
Mm.

502
31:26.480 --> 31:28.220
Since you came back from Xifu,

503
31:28.250 --> 31:30.650
