504
31:32.080 --> 31:32.910
Heated up?

505
31:32.930 --> 31:34.150
It's frozen.

506
31:34.980 --> 31:36.070
What happened?

507
31:39.660 --> 31:40.720
What exactly happened,

508
31:40.720 --> 31:41.660
my dear Lili?

509
31:43.250 --> 31:44.570
Did he bully you?

510
31:45.660 --> 31:46.570
If it really doesn't work out,

511
31:46.570 --> 31:47.570
I'll just go straight

512
31:47.570 --> 31:48.850
EAW to beat him up.

513
31:50.460 --> 31:51.250
Tangy.

514
31:51.550 --> 31:53.420
Actually, there's something

515
31:53.420 --> 31:54.680
I haven't told you yet.

516
31:55.010 --> 31:56.460
Besides all that

517
31:56.550 --> 31:57.770
