519
31:59.810 --> 32:01.010
I went back this time.

520
32:02.770 --> 32:03.770
Heartbreak?

521
32:09.760 --> 32:10.810
Doesn't that mean

522
32:10.830 --> 32:12.540
you told him you liked him

523
32:12.570 --> 32:13.700
right to his face?

524
32:14.770 --> 32:16.070
Did he reject you?

525
32:17.880 --> 32:19.210
He really rejected you?

526
32:23.420 --> 32:25.020
Fu Shize has terrible taste.

527
32:25.610 --> 32:26.420
But Lili,

528
32:26.770 --> 32:28.270
I never thought

529
32:28.270 --> 32:29.610
