530
32:30.810 --> 32:31.720
Indeed,

531
32:31.980 --> 32:33.770
I was bold as brass.

532
32:34.010 --> 32:35.010
Didn't he chase you

533
32:35.010 --> 32:36.070
all the way to Xifu?

534
32:36.220 --> 32:37.280
So there's no hope?

535
32:38.380 --> 32:39.960
He went there for work.

536
32:39.960 --> 32:41.980
And after he came back,

537
32:42.490 --> 32:44.890
I feel like he's deliberately avoiding me.

538
32:45.640 --> 32:46.040
You...

539
32:52.770 --> 32:54.010
Actually,

540
32:54.880 --> 32:56.980
Xia told me some things

541
32:58.010 --> 32:59.050
about Fu Shize.

542
33:00.460 --> 33:01.460
What is it?

543
33:03.660 --> 33:06.260
Didn't he take a leave of absence from college?

544
33:07.550 --> 33:08.920
He did that because

545
33:08.920 --> 33:10.480
some bad things happened

546
33:10.480 --> 33:11.510
in college.

547
33:11.570 --> 33:12.570
But as for the specific reasons,

548
33:12.570 --> 33:13.610
none of us know.

549
33:14.570 --> 33:16.150
Xia meant that her uncle

550
33:16.180 --> 33:17.850
wasn't like this before.

551
33:17.850 --> 33:18.750
wasn't like this.

552
33:18.750 --> 33:20.210
Because of this incident,

553
33:21.110 --> 33:22.510
he started to fall apart.

554
33:23.510 --> 33:25.110
Actually, I don't know

555
33:25.110 --> 33:26.310
if his rejection of me

556
33:26.610 --> 33:27.420
is also

557
33:27.420 --> 33:28.750
because of this reason.

558
33:29.070 --> 33:31.350
I've been deliberately ignoring all the ways

559
33:31.350 --> 33:33.590
he's made it clear, directly or indirectly,

560
33:33.590 --> 33:34.920
that he doesn't want me.

561
33:35.960 --> 33:37.180
I don't know how long

562
33:37.180 --> 33:38.710
this state of his will last.

563
33:39.570 --> 33:40.420
Forget it.

564
33:40.680 --> 33:41.660
It's your first relationship.

565
33:41.660 --> 33:43.920
You shouldn't have to go through so much.

566
33:44.660 --> 33:46.250
I'm not even dating yet.

567
33:46.600 --> 33:47.510
It's okay.

568
33:47.510 --> 33:48.220
Besides,

569
33:49.050 --> 33:50.880
I noticed so many little things.

570
33:50.880 --> 33:52.510
He is a really good person.

571
33:56.220 --> 33:57.980
When I told you to make a move,

572
33:58.180 --> 33:59.480
you ignored me.

573
33:59.680 --> 34:00.920
Now I'm telling you to give up,

574
34:00.920 --> 34:02.350
and you still ignore me?

575
34:04.180 --> 34:05.420
That just shows

576
34:05.420 --> 34:06.510
you are someone

577
34:06.920 --> 34:08.780
who can't read the room.

578
34:10.639 --> 34:11.440
True.

579
34:14.190 --> 34:14.790
By the way,

580
34:14.820 --> 34:17.020
how are things with you and Fu Zhengchu?

581
34:18.110 --> 34:19.370
How else could they be?

582
34:19.570 --> 34:20.550
Same old.

583
34:21.420 --> 34:22.940
I've been gone for days.

584
34:22.940 --> 34:24.300
Why is it still the same?

585
34:25.420 --> 34:26.210
Sometimes,

586
34:26.760 --> 34:27.480
you need to know

587
34:27.480 --> 34:29.570
when to cut your losses

588
34:29.730 --> 34:30.730
and stop.

589
34:32.820 --> 34:35.150
Why cut your losses all of a sudden?

590
34:35.380 --> 34:37.110
What happened between you two?

591
34:37.360 --> 34:38.739
I just feel that

592
34:39.550 --> 34:40.960
he has so many

593
34:40.960 --> 34:42.820
young and pretty girls around him.

594
34:42.820 --> 34:44.150
They are the same age.

595
34:45.050 --> 34:46.960
Why should I even get involved?

596
34:49.980 --> 34:51.360
You don't have a fever.

597
34:51.480 --> 34:53.010
Why are you talking nonsense?

598
34:53.010 --> 34:54.800
I'm serious.

599
34:58.960 --> 35:00.010
Do you know why

600
35:00.010 --> 35:00.980
I don't want others to know

601
35:00.980 --> 35:03.240
about my relationship with Fu Zhengchu?

602
35:05.550 --> 35:06.480
Some say

603
35:07.510 --> 35:09.320
the first thing you feel when you like someone

604
35:09.320 --> 35:10.280
is insecurity.

605
35:11.570 --> 35:13.430
I think that's exactly how I feel.

606
35:14.610 --> 35:15.280
I feel that

607
35:15.280 --> 35:16.920
I'm a few years older than him.

608
35:16.920 --> 35:17.780
What about him?

609
35:18.210 --> 35:19.210
He's young,

610
35:19.210 --> 35:19.980
handsome,

611
35:19.980 --> 35:21.150
and can skateboard.

612
35:21.150 --> 35:21.650
Everything about him

613
35:21.650 --> 35:23.260
is very attractive to girls.

614
35:26.550 --> 35:27.980
When I'm with him,

615
35:28.570 --> 35:31.170
I always feel like I'm taking advantage of him.

616
35:32.070 --> 35:32.760
Tangy,

617
35:32.920 --> 35:34.240
because you like him,

618
35:34.270 --> 35:36.080
you only see the good in him.

619
35:36.240 --> 35:37.030
I actually think

620
35:37.030 --> 35:38.620
you are shining.

621
35:38.650 --> 35:40.170
In the eyes of someone who likes you,

622
35:40.170 --> 35:41.920
you are shining.

623
35:45.280 --> 35:46.360
Besides, you're only

624
35:46.360 --> 35:47.820
a few years older than him.

625
35:48.260 --> 35:49.570
Why do you overthink it

626
35:49.940 --> 35:52.270
and bring yourself unnecessary trouble?

627
35:53.380 --> 35:54.260
Maybe Fu Zhengchu

628
35:54.260 --> 35:55.590
just likes older girls.

629
35:55.880 --> 35:56.980
Fu Zhengchu likes

630
35:56.980 --> 35:58.510
girls younger than him.

631
36:00.510 --> 36:01.670
I've seen him several times

632
36:01.670 --> 36:03.730
chatting happily with junior girls.

633
36:06.150 --> 36:07.050
Forget it.

634
36:08.210 --> 36:09.790
I've said what I needed to say

635
36:09.790 --> 36:11.810
and done what I needed to do.

636
36:13.590 --> 36:14.790
I should just give up.

637
36:17.360 --> 36:17.980
Alright.

638
36:18.650 --> 36:21.300
Whether you keep going or give up,

639
36:21.460 --> 36:22.570
I support you.

640
36:22.710 --> 36:24.510
But one thing is very important.

641
36:24.760 --> 36:26.890
You can't talk yourself down anymore.

642
36:28.170 --> 36:30.070
Our Tangy is incredibly beautiful,

643
36:30.070 --> 36:31.050
a young and gorgeous woman.

644
36:31.050 --> 36:31.710
If he doesn't like you,

645
36:31.710 --> 36:32.880
he's the one with bad taste.

646
36:32.880 --> 36:34.140
It's not your problem.

647
36:37.650 --> 36:38.900
Why does this sound

648
36:38.900 --> 36:40.170
so familiar?

649
36:42.260 --> 36:43.520
Fu Shize has bad taste.

650
36:45.430 --> 36:47.290
Fu Zhengchu has even worse taste.

651
36:47.960 --> 36:49.360
Only you have good taste.

652
36:51.360 --> 36:52.070
Exactly.

653
36:55.150 --> 36:55.880
Alright.

654
36:55.880 --> 36:57.070
You can stop here.

655
36:57.070 --> 36:58.330
I'll take the bus back.

656
36:58.610 --> 37:00.460
Remember to be happy.

657
37:00.480 --> 37:01.650
Got it.

658
37:02.750 --> 37:03.640
Good luck with Fu Shize.

659
37:03.640 --> 37:04.870
You can do it!

660
37:05.530 --> 37:06.500
Okay.

661
37:08.760 --> 37:10.570
But I have to go back to school soon

662
37:10.570 --> 37:11.770
to prepare for exams.

663
37:12.090 --> 37:13.190
I probably won't see him

664
37:13.190 --> 37:14.320
