665
37:14.960 --> 37:16.920
Absence makes the heart grow fonder.

666
37:16.920 --> 37:17.760
You can do it.

667
37:20.360 --> 37:21.730
Just go.

668
37:22.230 --> 37:22.960
I'm leaving.

669
37:29.240 --> 37:31.630
[Person on Duty: Tang Lin]

670
37:46.630 --> 37:47.280
Hello?

671
37:47.550 --> 37:48.610
What are you doing?

672
37:48.650 --> 37:49.480
Why haven't I seen you

673
37:49.480 --> 37:50.610
