684
38:05.280 --> 38:06.610
Does it concern you?

685
38:07.170 --> 38:07.860
If you have something to say, say it.

686
38:07.860 --> 38:08.610
If not, I'm hanging up.

687
38:08.610 --> 38:09.030
Don't.

688
38:09.960 --> 38:10.530
