691
38:13.460 --> 38:14.320
I'm hanging up.

692
38:14.730 --> 38:15.340
Tang Lin!

693
38:18.960 --> 38:20.890
See you at the usual place tonight.

694
38:21.420 --> 38:22.210
No matter how late,

695
38:22.210 --> 38:23.270
I will wait for you.

696
38:24.300 --> 38:25.230
You must come.

697
38:40.090 --> 38:40.940
Emergency.

698
38:41.050 --> 38:42.650
Which of you guys is at school?

699
38:42.650 --> 38:43.450
What's wrong?

700
38:43.630 --> 38:44.900
Mr. Zhang is crazy.

701
38:45.010 --> 38:46.780
He suddenly wants the test data by tomorrow.

702
38:46.780 --> 38:48.190
The data is in the lab.

703
38:48.460 --> 38:49.510
Who has time to get it

704
38:49.510 --> 38:50.700
and bring it to the classroom tomorrow morning?

705
38:50.700 --> 38:51.980
Undressed. Don't disturb.

706
38:51.980 --> 38:53.110
I'm not in the dorm today.

707
38:53.110 --> 38:54.710
I'm on the night shift today.

708
38:57.570 --> 38:58.440
I'll go.

709
38:58.610 --> 38:59.410
It's on my way.

710
39:35.320 --> 39:36.360
No way.

711
39:45.670 --> 39:46.600
Is anyone there?

712
39:47.380 --> 39:48.530
Can anyone hear me?

713
39:57.660 --> 40:00.290
[NUST Elevator Emergency Response Campus Safety Hotline (24/7)]

714
40:05.550 --> 40:08.170
Sorry, the number you dialed...

715
40:12.690 --> 40:13.730
Is anyone there?

716
40:14.260 --> 40:15.300
Don't worry.

717
40:15.360 --> 40:16.890
We'll handle it right away.

718
40:18.740 --> 40:20.320
[What should we do in a trapped lift?]

719
40:20.980 --> 40:22.610
Watch out for the gap between the elevator and the shaft wall.

720
40:22.610 --> 40:23.720
An old lady wasn't paying attention,

721
40:23.720 --> 40:24.960
ran out as soon as the door opened,

722
40:24.960 --> 40:25.730
and got stuck in the gap

723
40:25.730 --> 40:26.740
between the elevator car and the shaft wall.

724
40:26.740 --> 40:28.160
She starved to death.

725
40:30.780 --> 40:32.360
A falling elevator isn't scary.

726
40:32.360 --> 40:34.380
The scary part is it shooting upward.

727
40:34.380 --> 40:36.340
Anyone who has done elevator maintenance knows

728
40:36.340 --> 40:38.420
that inspection is just basic maintenance.

729
40:38.420 --> 40:39.610
If something really happens,

730
40:39.610 --> 40:41.270
you can only pray for the best.

731
40:59.300 --> 41:00.880
I'm trapped in the elevator.
